                                <note>Either on <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS1707AliBerr">ʿĀli Bǝrru</persName> or on <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS1688AliAlul">ʾAli ʾAlulā</persName>.</note>
                            </msItem>
                            <msItem xml:id="ms_i1.11">               
                                <locus from="29v"/>
                                <title>Chapter Eleven: On the Sending of Bishops to Ethiopia</title>
                                <incipit xml:lang="gez">ክፍል፡ ፲፩፡ ኮነት፡ ልማድ፡ በኀቤሆሙ፡ ለጳጳሳተ፡ ምስር፡ ከመ፡ ኢይፈንዉ፡ ጳጳሰ፡ ለብሔረ፡ ኢትዮጵያ፡ እመ፡ ኢፈነዉ፡ ሎሙ፡ ነገሥት፡
                                    ወመሳፍንተ፡ ላእካነ፡ ምስለ፡ ብዙኅ፡ ንዋይ፡</incipit>
                            </msItem>
                            <msItem xml:id="ms_i1.12">               
                                <locus from="31v"/>
                                <title>Chapter Twelve: About an Accomodation on the Way to Egypt</title>
                                <incipit xml:lang="gez">ክፍል፡ ፲፪ ወአመ፡ አልጸቁ፡ ለምስር፡ ተስእሎሙ፡ አቡነ፡ ለላእካን፡ ኀበ፡ አይቴ፡ ይፈተዉ፡ ማሕደረ፡ ዘይበውእዋ፡ ወሰሚዮ፡ ከመ፡ 
                                    ይፈትዉ፡ ኃዲረ፡ በጥቃ፡ ቤቱ፡ በአባ፡ ጲ<add place="below">ጥ</add>ሮስ፡ ተክህለ፡</incipit>
                            </msItem>
                            <msItem xml:id="ms_i1.13">               
                                <locus from="33v"/>
                                <title>Chapter Thirteen: Envoys of Daǧǧāč Wǝbe to Rome</title>
                                <incipit xml:lang="gez">ክፍል፡ ፲፫ <sic>ሣልስ።</sic> ወበከመ፡ ንቤ፡ እምቅድመዝ፡ አዘዞሙ፡ 
                                    <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS10102Webeha"><roleName type="title">ደጃች፡</roleName> ውቤ፡</persName> 
                                    ለላእካን፡ ይሑሩ፡ ሎቱ፡ ለ<persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS3451DeJacob"><roleName type="title">አቡነ፡</roleName> ያዕቆ፡</persName>
                                    ውስተ፡ ብሔረ፡ <placeName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LOC5374Rome">ሮማ፡</placeName> ለተራከቦ፡ ምስለ፡ ርእሰ፡ ሊቃነ፡ ጳጳሳት።</incipit>
                            </msItem>
                            <msItem xml:id="ms_i1.14">               
                                <locus from="35r"/>
                                <title>Chapter Fourteen: On the Crimes of Gʷaššu Bǝrru</title>
                                <incipit xml:lang="gez">ክፍል፡ ዓሥር፡ ወራብዕ። ወበውእቱ፡ ዘመን፡ ዐመፀ፡ ጐሹ፡ ብሩ፡ እምራስ፡ ዓሊ።</incipit>
                            </msItem>
                            <msItem xml:id="ms_i1.15">               
                                <locus from="37r"/>
                                <title>Chapter Fifteen: Regarding the Confirmation of a Letter to the Protestant Bishop Salāmā (?)</title>
                                <incipit xml:lang="gez">ክፍል፡ ዓሥር፡ ወሐምስ። ለአጠይቆተ፡ ነገር፡ ዘነበብናሁ፡ ከመ፡ አሤምዎ፡ ለጳጳስ፡ ሰላማ፡ ፕሮተስታንቲ፡ 
                                    ዘውእቶሙ፡ ፀረ፡ ማ<add place="below">ር</add>ያም፡ እንዘ፡ ይጼግዉ፡ ኅልያን፡ ለሊቀ፡ ጳ፡ ጴ፡ መጽኡ፡ ፪ ሰባኪያኒሆሙ፡</incipit>
                            </msItem>
                            <msItem xml:id="ms_i1.16">               
                                <locus from="38v"/>
                                <title>Chapter Sixteen: About the Martyr ʾAbbā Gabra Mikāʾel</title>
                                <incipit xml:lang="gez">ክፍል፡ ዓሥር፡ ወሣድስ። በእንተ፡ ዜናሁ፡ 
                                    ለ<persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS4340GabraMi"><roleName type="title">አባ፡</roleName> ገብረ፡ ሚካኤል፡</persName> ሰማዕት፡ 
                                    ዘውእቱ፡ ምክሆሙ፡ ለካቶሊካውያን፡ እለ፡ ሀለዉ፡ በኢትዮጵያ፡</incipit>
                            </msItem>
                            <msItem xml:id="ms_i1.17">               
                                <locus from="41v"/>
                                <title>Chapter Seventeen: On the struggles with Ṗāṗās Salāmā</title>
                                <incipit xml:lang="gez">ክፍል፡ ዓሥር፡ ወሰብዕ። ወዓዲ፡ ተበአሰ፡ ጳጳስ፡ ሰላማ፡ ምስለ፡ ካህናተ፡ ወልደ፡ ጸጋ፡ ወእጨጌ፡ ወንጉሠ፡ 
                                    <placeName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LOC5597Sawa">ሸዋ፡</placeName> <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS8346sahlase"> ሣህለ፡ ሥላሴ።</persName>
                                </incipit>
                            </msItem>
                            <msItem xml:id="ms_i1.18">               
                                <locus from="45r"/>
                                <title>Chapter Eighteen: On the Reconciliation of Wǝbe with Rās ʿĀli</title>
                                <incipit xml:lang="gez">ክፍል፡ ዓሥር፡ ወሣምን። ወገቢሮ፡ ዕርቀ፡ <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS10102Webeha">ውቤ፡</persName> ምስለ፡ 
                                    ዓሊ፡ አደወ፡ ምድረ፡ ትግሬ፡ ድኅረ፡ ክረምት፡ ወሰፈረ፡ በሐውዜን፡ ወመከረ፡ ከመ፡ ይሰድዶ፡ ለጳጳስ፡ ሰላማ፡ መንገለ፡ ሀገሩ፡</incipit>
                            </msItem>
                            <msItem xml:id="ms_i1.19">               
                                <locus from="47r"/>
                                <title>Chapter Nineteen: On the Appointment of ʾAbuna Yāʿqob by ʾAbuna Māsyās</title>
                                <incipit xml:lang="gez">ክፍል፡ ዓሥር፡ ወታስዕ። ወእምድኅረ፡ ሤሞ፡ አቡነ፡ ማሰያስ፡
                                    ለ<persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS3451DeJacob"><roleName type="title">አቡነ፡</roleName> ያዕቆብ፡</persName> ሢመተ፡ ጳጳስና፡  
                                    በትእዛዘ፡ ርእሰ፡ ሊቃነ፡ ጳጳሳት፡ በከመ፡ ተጽሐፈ፡ ውስተ፡ መጽሐፈ፡ ገድሉ፡</incipit>
                            </msItem>
                            <msItem xml:id="ms_i1.20">               
                                <locus target="#51v"/>
                                <title>Chapter Twenty: On the Announcement of Freedom of Belief by Wǝbe</title>
                                <incipit xml:lang="gez">ክፍል፡ ዕሥራ። ወበይእቲ፡ ዘመን፡ ገብረ፡ ቃለ፡ አዋዲ፡ <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS10102Webeha">ውቤ፡</persName>
                                    ኵሉ፡ ሰብዕ፡ ይንበር፡ ዘእንበለ፡ ካህድ፡ በበሃይማኖቱ።</incipit>
                            </msItem>
                            <msItem xml:id="ms_i1.21">               
                                <locus from="51v"/>
                                <title>Chapter Twenty-One: On the Imprisonment of ʾabbā Gabra Māryām and qasis Gabra Madḫǝn</title>
                                <incipit xml:lang="gez">ክፍል፡ ዕሥራ፡ ወአሐዱ። ወካዕበ፡ በካልዓይ፡ ዓመት፡ አመ፡ ፱ ለጥቅምት፡ ተአስሩ፡ አባ፡ ገብረ፡ ማርያም፡ ወቀሲስ፡ ገብረ፡ መድኅን፡
                                    ዘሐገረ፡ ጐልዓ።</incipit>
                            </msItem>
                            <msItem xml:id="ms_i1.22">               
                                <locus from="52r"/>
                                <title>Chapter Twenty-Two: On ʾAbuna Fǝremnāṭos and ʾAbuna Yāʿqob from Rome</title>
                                <incipit xml:lang="gez">ክፍል፡ እሥራ፡ ወ፪። ቀዳሚ፡ መጽአ፡ አቡነ፡ ፍሬምናጦስ፡ ምስለ፡
                                    <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS3451DeJacob"><roleName type="title">አቡነ፡</roleName> ያዕቆብ፡</persName> እምሮምያ፡ ወእምዝ፡ 
                                    አደወ፡ መንገለ፡ <placeName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LOC3577Gondar">ጐንደር፡</placeName></incipit>
                            </msItem>
                            <msItem xml:id="ms_i1.23">               
                                <locus from="53r"/>
                                <title>Chapter Twenty-Three: On the Coming of ʾAbuna Biancheri and ʾAbuna Yāʿqob from Rome</title>
                                <incipit xml:lang="gez">ክፍል፡ እሥራ፡ ወ፫። በከመ፡ ንቤ፡ እምቅድመዝ፡ መጽአ፡ 
                                    <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS2763Biancher"><roleName type="title">አቡነ፡</roleName> ብያንከሪ፡</persName> 
                                    ምስለ፡ <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS3451DeJacob"><roleName type="title">አቡነ፡</roleName> ያዕቆብ፡</persName>
                                    እምሮምያ፡ በዳግም፡ ምጽአቱ፡</incipit>
                            </msItem>
                            <msItem xml:id="ms_i1.24">               
                                <locus from="55v"/>
                                <title>Chapter Twenty-Four: On the Departure from Ḥalāy (?)</title>
                                <incipit xml:lang="gez">ክፍል፡ እሥራ፡ ወ፬። ወእምድኅረ፡ ተንሥአ፡ ውእቱ፡ እም<placeName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LOC3751Halay">ሀላይ፡</placeName>
                                    በኅዳጥ፡ መዋዕል፡ ኮነ፡ ጋዕዝ፡ ብዙኃ፡ በቤቱ።</incipit>
                            </msItem>
                            <msItem xml:id="ms_i1.25">               
                                <locus from="57r"/>
                                <title>Chapter Twenty-Five: On the Śǝyyum of Tambien Walda Giyorgis visiting Wǝbe</title>
                                <incipit xml:lang="gez">ክፍል፡ ዕሥራ፡ ወ፭። በከመ፡ ንቤ፡ እምቅድመዝ፡ እምድኅረ፡ ገብሩ፡ ዕርቀ፡ ጳ፡ ወመስፍን፡ አንቅሖ፡ ሥዩመ፡ 
                                    <placeName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LOC5882Tamben">ተምቤን፡</placeName> ወልደጊዮርጊስ፡ ለእግዚኡ፡ 
                                    <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS10102Webeha">ውቤ፡</persName> እንዘ፡ ይብል፡</incipit>
                            </msItem>
                            <msItem xml:id="ms_i1.26">               
                                <locus from="58r"/>
                                <title>Chapter Twenty-Six: On the submission of Damot and ʾAgaw by Rās ʿĀli</title>
                                <incipit xml:lang="gez">ክፍል፡ እሥራ፡ ወ፮። ወተመዊኦ፡ ራስ፡ ዓሊ፡ ምሰጠ፡ እምእደ፡ ጸላኢሁ፡ ወአደወ፡ 
                                    ምድረ፡ <placeName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LOC2488Damot">ደሞት፡</placeName> 
                                    ወ<placeName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LOC1241AgawMe">አገው፡</placeName> ወፅአ፡ 
                                    በ<placeName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LOC2385DabraT">ደብረ፡ ታቦር።</placeName></incipit>
                            </msItem>
                            <msItem xml:id="ms_i1.27">               
                                <locus from="59r"/>
                                <title>Chapter Twenty-Seven: A new announcement on faith</title>
                                <incipit xml:lang="gez">ክፍል፡ ዕሥራ፡ ወ፯። ወአሜሃ፡ አስሪፆሙ፡ ሐደሰ፡ ሃይማኖተ፡ ተነግረ፡ ካዕበ፡ ቃለ፡ ዓዋዲ፡ ዘይብል፡ ኵሉ፡ ዘኢየአምን፡ ከመ፡ ክርስቶስ፡
                                    ውእቱ፡ አምላክ፡ በተስብእቱ፡ ወከመሂ፡ የአምር፡ በሰብእናሁ፡ ከመ፡ አብ፡ ወመንፈስ፡ ቅዱስ።</incipit>
                            </msItem>
                            <msItem xml:id="ms_i1.28">               
                                <locus target="#59v"/>
                                <title>Chapter Twenty-Eight: On the Bishop and King Tewodros at ʾAmbā Č̣arā</title>
                                <incipit xml:lang="gez">ክፍል፡ እሥራ፡ ወ፰። በከመ፡ ንቤ፡ እምቅድመዝ፡ እንዘ፡ ሀለዉ፡ ጳ፡ 
                                    <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS9430Tewodros">ወቴዎድሮስ፡</persName> በአምባ፡ ጨራ፡</incipit>
                            </msItem>
                            <msItem xml:id="ms_i1.29">               
                                <locus target="#59v"/>
                                <title>Chapter Twenty-Nine: On an Apostate</title>
                                <incipit xml:lang="gez">ክፍል፡ እሥራ፡ ወ፱። ወእምድኅረዝ፡ በ፲ መዋዕል፡ ክህደ፡ ፩ እምኔሆሙ።</incipit>
                            </msItem>
                            <msItem xml:id="ms_i1.30">               
                                <locus from="59v"/>
                                <title>Chapter Thirty: On the Bishops Decree to Take away the Prisoners before Holding the Council (?)</title>
                                <incipit xml:lang="gez">ክፍል፡ ሠላሳ። በከመ፡ ንቤ፡ እምቅድምዝ፡ አዘዘ፡ ጳ፡ ያእትትዎሙ፡ ለሙቁሐን፡ እምቅድመ፡ ጉባኤ።</incipit>
                            </msItem>
                            <msItem xml:id="ms_i1.31">               
                                <locus from="60r" to="74r"/>
                                <title>Chapter Thirty-One: The Story of Tewodros’ Lion</title>
                                <incipit xml:lang="gez">ክፍል፡ ሠላሳ፡ <supplied reason="omitted" resp="PRS8999Strelcyn">ወ፩</supplied>። ወበእንተ፡ ዜና፡                                   
                                    አንበሳሁ፡ <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS9430Tewodros">ለቴዎድሮስ</persName>።</incipit>
                            </msItem>
                        </msItem>
